          "name": "newracom:notes",
          "value": "Composition established 2026-09-23 from the link map and dependency files of NRC_MACSW@223b4ae (target nrc7394.cspi+sdk+). 128 project objects are linked flat; the only archives are toolchain ones. Third-party content is the five components listed below (freertos-kernel, newlib, libgcc, cmsis-core, mpaland-printf) plus the BSD dl_list header in util/util_list.h. No cryptographic library is linked - AES/SHA/MD5 constant tables are absent and ciphering is done by the MAC hardware key engine. No outbound network capability: no URL, domain or telemetry strings. Version reported by the image is the SDK version (VERSION-SDK); the internal firmware VERSION file reads 6.2.0. The image embeds __DATE__/__TIME__, so builds are not bit-reproducible and hash comparison cannot be used to verify a release. nrc7394_cspi_eeprom.bin has an identical source composition and is covered by the same component list. Composition re-verified on the v1.3.3 release build (firmware commit 993f213, built 2026-09-24): identical 128 objects, the same 7 FreeRTOS files, no cryptographic constant tables, no network endpoint strings."
        }
